	(paper "A1")
	(title_block
		(title "PATIENT: patient relay K1401 + 12 V coil supply, hold-up, economiser and aux contact; pad connector; pad ID and presence; pad NTC")
		(date "2026-11-27")
		(rev "A-draft")
		(company "Open AED project — CERN-OHL-S-2.0 — NOT FOR CONSTRUCTION")
		(comment 1 "NOT FOR CONSTRUCTION — unreviewed design")
		(comment 2 "Source: docs/HARDWARE_DESIGN.md v0.3 §B7; hardware/aed-main/contract.md issue 3 §0, §5.7, §5.8, §8; rev3-changes.md WP-H; capture notes WP-H")
		(comment 3 "At rest the pads connect to the front ends (PT_FE_A/B); only an energised K1401 connects them to the bridge (HV_OUT_A/B).")
		(comment 4 "K1401 is a PLACEHOLDER for a MADE-TO-ORDER relay that does not exist yet (D-64, docs/requirements/patient-relay.md): pin numbers and ratings are requirements, not a part.")
		(comment 5 "Revision 0.3: the coil supply (Q1401 + U1401) is enabled by K_SUPPLY_EN from the main controller and filled before the shock; K_EN now enables only the coil driver U1402.")
		(comment 6 "Generated by tools/schgen from the sheet spec — edit the spec, not this file (until schematic freeze)")
