			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8489d6dc-d857-51a3-a850-f3c91a7c9935")
	)
	(text_box "Sized [CALC, notes §3.5] for the worst case: boost lost at the earliest sequence start (~20 ms after K_EN) while the DRV110 is still in its 33 ms peak phase (coil resistive, tau =\nR_coil x C), then hold at 0.5 A regulated. Hot coil 15 ohm (hold needs >= 7.8 V): ~48 ms; boost lost during hold: ~60 ms; both > 30 ms. 4.4 mF would leave ~30 ms with no margin; the\ndesign's 1.7 mF assumed a constant 3 W draw and no peak phase.\nPre-charge (revision 0.3): filled under K_SUPPLY_EN before the shock is due (budget ~2 A for ~0.1 s, H-6), held at ~11.8 V until K_SUPPLY_EN falls; standby voltage 0 V. Discharge after\na shock through the DRV110 supply (0.2-0.25 mA standby, SLVSBA8G) and leakage.\nWith the 2.0 A boost limit the coil peak phase draws more than the boost supplies at a low battery, so the reservoir is below 11.6 V when a sequence starts; simulated hold-up after a\nboost/VBAT_SYS loss: capture notes WP-H, Revision 0.3.\nNichicon UHE1C332MHD: 16 V, 3300 uF, 12.5 x 35.5 mm, -40..+105 C; 13.6 V worst-case OVP = 85 % of rating."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 306.36 131.062 0)
		(size 208.28 19.272)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "29725a0c-7359-5c9d-b695-a55882aef268")
	)
